1
0:00:02,080 --> 0:00:05,920
Raat ko woh so rahi thi,
maine uska WhatsApp khola

2
0:00:06,330 --> 0:00:10,330
Galat tha, par dil keh raha tha,
kuch toh hai jo usne nahi bola

3
0:00:10,660 --> 0:00:14,510
Weeks se woh kahin aur thi,
dinner pe, car mein bhi

4
0:00:15,200 --> 0:00:18,410
Fourteen years saath,
par itni door kabhi nahi lagi

5
0:00:19,230 --> 0:00:23,250
Meera ko ek message,
andhere mein screen jo jali

6
0:00:23,780 --> 0:00:26,530
"Forty-four ka hai,
seventy jaisa chalta hai,

7
0:00:26,530 --> 0:00:27,990
koi spark nahi, kuch nahi"

8
0:00:28,320 --> 0:00:31,780
Phone wahin rakh diya,
aur floor pe let gaya

9
0:00:32,080 --> 0:00:35,520
Morning ka itna wait,
maine pehle kabhi na kiya

10
0:00:36,420 --> 0:00:40,360
Bura yeh nahi ki usne kaha,
bura yeh tha ki woh sahi thi

11
0:00:40,680 --> 0:00:42,700
Three years ka back pain,
eleven hours desk pe,

12
0:00:42,700 --> 0:00:44,870
two hours local mein khade,
har raat yahi thi

13
0:00:44,870 --> 0:00:47,280
Ghar aake seedha floor pe,
na baat karne ki energy,

14
0:00:47,280 --> 0:00:49,090
na usko hug karne
ki strength bachi thi

15
0:00:49,290 --> 0:00:51,310
Cousin ke sangeet mein main
plastic chair pe baitha raha

16
0:00:51,310 --> 0:00:53,840
Woh sabke saath naachi, main
wahan hoke bhi wahan nahi raha

17
0:00:53,840 --> 0:00:55,470
Anniversary dinner cancel kiya,

18
0:00:55,470 --> 0:00:58,120
bola thak gaya hoon,
main hamesha thaka hi rehta tha

19
0:00:58,120 --> 0:01:01,560
Har raat painkillers, sprays
jinki smell hospital ward jaisi

20
0:01:01,560 --> 0:01:03,050
Balm jo ten minutes jalte,

21
0:01:03,050 --> 0:01:05,890
physio eight hundred ka ek
session, pocket pe bhaari aisi

22
0:01:05,890 --> 0:01:08,720
Thousands of rupees gaye,
aur haath mein kuch nahi

23
0:01:08,930 --> 0:01:13,420
Pehle neend le gaya,
phir le gaya mera fire

24
0:01:13,420 --> 0:01:17,720
Le gaya woh aadmi,
jise woh karti thi admire

25
0:01:18,120 --> 0:01:22,240
Dard sirf kamar mein
nahi rehta, sach hai yaar

26
0:01:22,430 --> 0:01:27,990
Neend, strength, sab le gaya,
aur le gaya uska pyaar

27
0:01:36,430 --> 0:01:40,730
Building C mein ek uncle the,
fifty-five ke toh honge at least

28
0:01:40,950 --> 0:01:42,570
Har subah shuttle smash karte,

29
0:01:42,570 --> 0:01:44,920
jaise back ho twenty-five ka,
full speed

30
0:01:45,250 --> 0:01:49,500
Main balcony se dekhta rehta,
aadha zinda, bilkul weak

31
0:01:49,830 --> 0:01:53,640
Ek din lift mein poochh liya,
"Uncle, kya use karte ho?"

32
0:01:53,840 --> 0:01:55,720
Hans ke upar gaye, laut ke aaye,

33
0:01:55,720 --> 0:01:57,900
haath mein chhoti
si amber bottle leke

34
0:01:58,200 --> 0:02:00,680
"Warm karo, sone se
ten minutes pehle malo,

35
0:02:00,680 --> 0:02:02,280
sprays phenk do, samjhe?"

36
0:02:04,020 --> 0:02:07,910
Us raat woh chup chaap dekhti
rahi, maine palms mein warm kiya

37
0:02:07,910 --> 0:02:09,350
Na burning, na hospital ki smell,

38
0:02:09,350 --> 0:02:12,050
seedha deep andar,
jahan dard tha wahin gaya

39
0:02:12,050 --> 0:02:15,250
Night three poori neend aayi,
months ke baad pehli baar

40
0:02:15,250 --> 0:02:17,950
Week two bed se utha,
bina groan kiye, na ek baar

41
0:02:17,950 --> 0:02:20,670
Week four station ki stairs,
two at a time chadha

42
0:02:21,120 --> 0:02:23,380
Month two mein poocha,
"Marine Drive pe walk?"

43
0:02:23,380 --> 0:02:25,780
Aur is baar usne haath pakda

44
0:02:28,100 --> 0:02:32,160
Kuch Sundays baad, subah
subah main chai bana raha tha

45
0:02:32,380 --> 0:02:36,440
Woh Meera se phone pe thi,
aur main sun raha tha

46
0:02:36,680 --> 0:02:38,520
"Pata nahi kya hua Meera,

47
0:02:38,520 --> 0:02:43,170
mujhe wapas mil gaya woh,
jisse shaadi ki thi"

48
0:02:44,350 --> 0:02:48,730
Wapas mili meri neend,
wapas mila mera fire

49
0:02:48,730 --> 0:02:53,500
Phir se main wahi aadmi,
jise woh karti hai admire

50
0:02:55,230 --> 0:02:59,980
Naam hai EIS Ayurvedic
Pain Relief Oil

51
0:03:00,330 --> 0:03:02,900
Fifteen-plus Ayurvedic herbs,
Mahanarayan,

52
0:03:02,900 --> 0:03:05,520
Nirgundi, Ashwagandha,
warm til oil mein

53
0:03:05,520 --> 0:03:08,000
Sprays aur balm skin pe reh jaate,

54
0:03:08,000 --> 0:03:10,720
warm massage se yeh
muscle aur joint tak jaata

55
0:03:10,960 --> 0:03:16,300
Inflammation calm karta,
knot ko loose karta,

56
0:03:16,300 --> 0:03:17,720
bas yahi hai point

57
0:03:18,700 --> 0:03:22,890
Real Indians already raat
bhar chain se so rahe hain

58
0:03:23,260 --> 0:03:28,050
Aaj order karo, cash on delivery,
tonight se start karo
